  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d95f71226bf26bc4caed6a0458a3b538, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lesson 8 Question 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  question: Can God do absolutely everything?
  answers:
  - Absolutely, yes
  - No, only things consistent with His nature
  - He can makes puzzles He can't figure out
  - He can make rocks too big for Him to lift
  correctAnswerIndex: 1
  discussionAnswer: At all times, God does only what He wants to do - and He wants
    to do only what is right.  God cannot sin, nor can He contradict His own nature
    or Word.
